# No push until asked

- **Never** run `git push` (or any remote push) unless Jacob explicitly asks in the current turn.
- Local edits, commits (only when asked), tests, and builds are fine.
- Finishing a task is not permission to push. Wait for clear go-ahead (e.g. "push it", "push when ready").
